
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>MTN MoMo Easy Loans</title>
<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{margin:0;font-family:Arial;background:#f4f5f7;color:#222}
header{background:#ffcc00;padding:22px;text-align:center}
header h1{margin:0;font-size:25px}
main{max-width:480px;margin:35px auto;padding:20px}
.card{background:white;padding:25px;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 3px 15px #ddd}
h2{text-align:center}
p{text-align:center;color:#555;line-height:1.6}
label{display:block;margin-top:15px;font-weight:bold}
input,textarea{width:100%;padding:13px;margin-top:7px;border:1px solid #ccc;border-radius:7px;font-size:16px}
button,.telegram{display:block;width:100%;padding:15px;background:#ffcc00;border:0;border-radius:8px;font-weight:bold;text-align:center;text-decoration:none;color:#111;margin-top:20px;font-size:16px}
.telegram{background:#229ed9;color:white}
.notice{font-size:12px;color:#777;margin-top:20px}
footer{text-align:center;padding:20px;font-size:12px;color:#666}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header>
<h1>MTN MoMo Easy Loans</h1>
<p>Independent Loan Enquiry Service</p>
</header>
<main>
<div class="card">
<h2>Welcome</h2>
<p>Interested in learning about loan options? Send an enquiry to our team.</p>

<form id="loanForm">
<label>Your Full Name</label>
<input id="name" required maxlength="80" placeholder="Enter your name">

<label>Phone Number (Optional)</label>
<input id="phone" maxlength="25" placeholder="Enter phone number">

<label>Amount Requested (KES)</label>
<input id="amount" type="number" min="1" required placeholder="Enter amount">

<label>Loan Purpose</label>
<textarea id="purpose" rows="3" placeholder="What is the loan for?"></textarea>

<button type="submit">Send Loan Enquiry</button>
</form>

<a class="telegram" href="https://t.me/Mia_katty1" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Chat on Telegram</a>

<p class="notice">
This is an independent enquiry service, not an official MTN or MoMo website. An enquiry does not guarantee loan approval. Never share your PIN, password or OTP, and do not pay advance fees.
</p>
</div>
</main>
<footer>
MTN MoMo Easy Loans<br>
Telegram: @Mia_katty1
</footer>
<script>
document.getElementById("loanForm").addEventListener("submit",function(e){
e.preventDefault();
const message="Loan enquiry\nName: "+document.getElementById("name").value+
"\nPhone: "+document.getElementById("phone").value+
"\nAmount: KES "+document.getElementById("amount").value+
"\nPurpose: "+document.getElementById("purpose").value;
window.open("https://t.me/Mia_katty1?text="+encodeURIComponent(message),"_blank");
});
</script>
</body>
</html>
